  NotesT -->|note_id| Comments
  Workspaces -->|workspace_id| FilesT
  Workspaces -->|workspace_id| Inbox
  User -->|user_id| Inbox
  User -->|user_id| Prefs
  FlagsT -->|flag_key| Rules
